### 促購機制活動限額 API 測試
### 完整測試流程：建立活動 → 分發代碼 → 兌換測試 → 退貨測試


### ModeType 決定「碼從哪裡來」；
### DispatchType 決定「碼怎麼被拿」!!

# 環境變數設定
# @baseUrl=http://promocodepool-api.qa1.hk.91dev.tw
#@baseUrl=http://promocodepool-api.qa1.my.91dev.tw


@baseUrl =http://promocodepool-api.91app.io
@market=TW
@shopId=37868
@sourceType=PromotionReward
@ny_user_id=rest_client
@testUserId=32905
@testUserId2=user2
@tw37868Group=8EeOwI0bNEC-8PzaFVvwjA
@tw37868CodeId=552c7d
@tw37868Label=TG260108GA008K
@tw37868ReceiverId=95262655


###############################################
### 第一階段：建立活動群組（每用戶限制3次）
###############################################


### 1. 建立限制群組 - 每個用戶最多兌換2次
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups
Content-Type: application/json
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}


{
  "modeType": "Functional",
  "dispatchType": "Random",
  "pattern": "GUID6",
  "limitRuleSettings": [
    {
      "actionType": "Redeem",
      "limitTarget": 2,
      "limitRules": [
        {
          "quota": 2
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "canRedeemDirectly": true,
  "since": "2025-08-14T20:00:00Z",
  "until": "2025-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

#groupId

### 2. 啟用群組
@groupId=MSS3BR6MHEGcboxhNoF3gw
# 請將 {{groupId}} 替換為步驟1回傳的群組ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/enable
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}


# true


### 3. 查詢群組資訊確認設定
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{tw37868Group}}
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}


### 4. 更新 Group
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}
Content-Type: application/json
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}

{
  "modeType": "Functional",
  "dispatchType": "Random",
  "pattern": "GUID6",
  "limitRuleSettings": [
    {
      "actionType": "Redeem",
      "limitTarget": 3,
      "limitRules": [
        {
          "quota": 3
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "canRedeemDirectly": true,
  "since": "2025-08-13T21:00:00",
  "until": "2025-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

###############################################
### 第三階段：兌換測試（模擬付款成功）
###############################################


### 4. 分發第1個代碼給用戶 user001
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/dispatch-and-redeem
Content-Type: application/json
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}
ny-idempotency-key: dispatch-{{testUserId}}-001-{{$guid}}


{
  "receiverId": "{{testUserId}}",
  "tags": [],
  "labels": ["TG250814DDD"]
}


### 4. 分發第1個代碼給用戶 user001
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/dispatch-and-redeem
Content-Type: application/json
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}
ny-idempotency-key: dispatch-{{testUserId}}-001-{{$guid}}


{
  "receiverId": "{{testUserId}}",
  "tags": [],
  "labels": ["TG250814FFFF"]
}



### 8. 查詢用戶的所有代碼

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/codes/get-by-receiver?ReceiverId={{tw37868ReceiverId}}&Start=2025-11-01T00:00:00Z&End=2027-01-24T23:59:59Z&Limit=10
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{tw37868ReceiverId}}



### 8.2 分發第1個代碼給用戶 user002
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/dispatch-and-redeem
Content-Type: application/json
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}
ny-idempotency-key: dispatch-{{testUserId2}}-001-{{$guid}}


{
  "receiverId": "{{testUserId2}}",
  "tags": [],
  "labels": ["TG04"]
}


###
@label=MG250919Q00002
@groupId=MSS3BR6MHEGcboxhNoF3gw
### 9. 根據標籤查詢代碼
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/codes/get-by-label?GroupId={{tw37868Group}}&Label={{tw37868Label}}&Limit=10
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}


### 12. 查詢用戶限額狀況（應該顯示已用完 3/3）

@memberId=95262655
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{tw37868Group}}/limit-quotas?ActionType=Redeem&ReceiverId={{memberId}}
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}


###############################################
### 第四階段：退貨測試（釋放配額）
###############################################
### 27. 測試同時取消分發和兌換
@codeId=0f7a9e
# 請將 {codeId} 替換為要處理的代碼ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/codes/{{codeId}}/reverse-redeemed-and-dispatched
Content-Type: application/json
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{testUserId}}
ny-idempotency-key: reverse-all-{{testUserId}}-{{$guid}}


{
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}",
  "receiverId": "{{testUserId}}"
}


###############################################
### 第六階段：管理和監控 API
###############################################


### 20. 查詢群組統計數據
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{tw37868Group}}/metrics
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}


### 21. 查詢特定代碼狀態
# 請將 {{codeId1}} 替換為要查詢的代碼ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{tw37868Group}}/codes/{{tw37868CodeId}}
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}


### 23. 批量查詢多個群組
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/batch-get?GroupIds={{tw37868Group}}
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}


### 24. 批量查詢多個群組的統計
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/batch-get-metrics?GroupIds={{tw37868Group}}
ny-market: {{market}}
ny-shop-id: {{shopId}}
ny-source-type: {{sourceType}}
ny-user-id: {{ny_user_id}}
